WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
- What was your experience
like at McDonald's?

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.180
Was it hard like that?

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:07.290
- Oh no, I just was reflected

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.030
on something crazy I did once

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:09.863
when I was working there.

00:00:09.863 --> 00:00:10.800
- Wait, I want to know.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:11.700
- [Andie] Okay.
- Tell me, please.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.200
- All right, it makes me sound terrible.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.033
I promise you-

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:14.969
- I love your stories.

00:00:14.969 --> 00:00:15.802
(Andie, Whitney and Kelly laughing)

00:00:15.802 --> 00:00:17.460
- It was the only time
I've ever done this.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.320
You may not believe it
but it is the truth.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.039
- [Kelly] Okay.
- I smoked some hash.

00:00:21.039 --> 00:00:21.872
(Whitney gasping)

00:00:21.872 --> 00:00:22.705
- [Kelly] Just once?

00:00:22.705 --> 00:00:23.538
(audience laughing)

00:00:23.538 --> 00:00:25.050
- What?
- And I went to work stoned,

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.100
but this is...

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.360
I'm old so we had to count back change.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.468
This is before they counted the-

00:00:31.468 --> 00:00:32.301
- [Kelly] You had to do it and I had to-

00:00:32.301 --> 00:00:33.780
- Exactly, I had to count
back the change myself-

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.217
- You're stoned.

00:00:35.217 --> 00:00:36.990
- And I was so stoned.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.880
It was just unbelievable,

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.246
and the concentration it took

00:00:41.246 --> 00:00:42.145
(Andie, Whitney and Kelly
and audience laughing)

00:00:42.145 --> 00:00:46.170
to give people back the
right amount of money

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.187
was unbelievable.

00:00:48.187 --> 00:00:49.890
- [Kelly] Oh my God.
- And I still can't believe it

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:51.120
that I pulled it off.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:51.953
I don't know.

00:00:51.953 --> 00:00:52.786
I was like,

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.098
"What are they going to
find the end of the day?"

00:00:54.098 --> 00:00:55.827
(Andie and Kelly laughing)

00:00:55.827 --> 00:00:56.660
It was like...

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:57.493
I did it, though.
- Oh my God,

00:00:57.493 --> 00:00:59.471
and your first time.
- Oh wow, it's painful.

00:00:59.471 --> 00:01:00.304
- That has to be like...

00:01:00.304 --> 00:01:01.560
That's a pretty big experience.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.445
- [Andie] Yes.
- Not that I would know.

00:01:02.445 --> 00:01:05.730
- I'm not very good at smoking pot anyway.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:06.701
I'm just not good at it.

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:07.534
- I'm not good at...

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:08.430
I don't smoke anything, I'm a singer,

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:10.830
but I can't imagine your first time,

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.270
and then your-
- Oh wow, man.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:13.103
- You were probably...
- Yeah.

00:01:13.103 --> 00:01:13.936
- That person was probably like-

00:01:13.936 --> 00:01:14.910
- Oof.
- what is wrong with...

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:15.996
She was like 10.

00:01:15.996 --> 00:01:16.829
(Andie laughing)

00:01:16.829 --> 00:01:17.820
- Yeah.
- 20.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:18.690
Wait, can you give me that back?

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:19.707
Where was I?

00:01:19.707 --> 00:01:20.540
(Andie, Kelly and audience laughing)

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.140
- I had to do that once, one time,

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:23.250
because the machine broke-

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.083
- [Andie] Oh dear.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:24.990
- And I panicked.
- [Andie] Yeah.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:26.039
- [Kelly] And she wasn't stoned.

00:01:26.039 --> 00:01:26.872
- And I wasn't doing long...

00:01:26.872 --> 00:01:27.705
Exactly.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:27.705 --> 00:01:28.538
- And I was completely fine.

00:01:28.538 --> 00:01:30.120
- I used to count back change in my sleep,

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.410
I'm telling you, it was in my head.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:32.490
- We used to do a lot of things

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:33.450
before technology,

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:35.760
like I knew numbers, like I could call...

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.020
I knew everyone's phone number.

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:37.853
I don't know anyone's-

00:01:37.853 --> 00:01:39.000
- I know, it's terrifying now.
- Yeah.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.560
- You don't know people's
telephone numbers.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.393
- So terrifying.

00:01:41.393 --> 00:01:43.230
- I can remember my
original telephone number-

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:44.520
- [Kelly] Me too.
- From growing up.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.353
- 817.

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:47.393
- Whoa.

00:01:47.393 --> 00:01:48.510
- [Kelly] I know, well.
- [Andie] Yeah.

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:49.343
- Okay.
- It was...

00:01:49.343 --> 00:01:50.900
I know, we're a different generation.

